                                "sense_id": "9965c0bc-9aae-3aa5-ae73-64dd575435dc",
                                "text": "Tu sais pertinemment que je déteste quand tu fais ça, donc pourquoi est-ce que tu le fais quand même ?",
                                "translation": "You know full well I hate it when you do that, so why do you do it anyway?",
                                "english": "You know full well I hate it when you do that, so why do you do it anyway?"
